---
/**
 * WhyLocalFirstSection
 *
 * Explains the strategic problem before introducing the technical solution.
 * Local-first is presented as optionality, not as an anti-cloud position.
 */
---

<section
  class="section why-local-first"
  id="why-local-first"
  aria-labelledby="why-local-first-title"
>
  <div class="shell">

    <div class="why-heading reveal">
      <p class="section-kicker">WHY LOCAL-FIRST</p>

      <h2 id="why-local-first-title">
        The problem isn't the cloud.
        <strong>It's depending on intelligence you don't control.</strong>
      </h2>

      <p class="why-sub">
        Closed APIs are powerful. The risk is making them your <strong>only execution path</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>


    <div class="dependency-grid">

      <article class="dependency-card reveal">
        <span class="dependency-index">01</span>
        <h3>Model lifecycle</h3>
        <p>Pin models and migrate on your timeline, not the provider's forced deprecations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dependency-card reveal">
        <span class="dependency-index">02</span>
        <h3>Cost dependency</h3>
        <p>Turn recurring inference into fixed capacity costs instead of per-token fees.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dependency-card reveal">
        <span class="dependency-index">03</span>
        <h3>Data boundaries</h3>
        <p>Keep sensitive processing and private data strictly on infrastructure you control.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="dependency-card reveal">
        <span class="dependency-index">04</span>
        <h3>Exit optionality</h3>
        <p>Build alternative execution paths before provider lock-in forces your hand.</p>
      </article>

    </div>


    <div class="evidence-block reveal">

      <div class="evidence-grid">

        <article class="evidence-item">
          <strong class="evidence-number">61 days</strong>
          <p>Window between Claude Opus 4.1 deprecation notice and total API retirement.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="evidence-item">
          <strong class="evidence-number">71%</strong>
          <p>Of IT decision-makers actively maintain an AI-provider exit strategy.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="evidence-item">
          <strong class="evidence-number">4B</strong>
          <p>Qwen3.5-4B delivers 79.1 MMLU-Pro locally with 262k context window.</p>
        </article>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="local-first-thesis reveal">

      <div class="thesis-header">
        <p class="section-kicker">LOCAL-FIRST ≠ LOCAL-ONLY</p>
        <h3>
          Use frontier models when you need capability, 
          <strong>not because you have no other choice.</strong>
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="thesis-principles">
        <div class="principle-chip">
          <span class="chip-dot dot-teal"></span>
          <span><strong>Local</strong> where sufficient</span>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-chip">
          <span class="chip-dot dot-blue"></span>
          <span><strong>Cloud</strong> where valuable</span>
        </div>
        <div class="principle-chip">
          <span class="chip-dot dot-indigo"></span>
          <span><strong>Portable</strong> by design</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<style>
  .why-local-first {
    background: var(--surface-card);
  }

  .why-heading {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .why-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 780px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.5vw, 2.3rem);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .why-heading h2 strong {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  .why-heading > p:last-child {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }


  .dependency-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .dependency-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface-canvas);
    transition: transform var(--duration-fast) ease, border-color var(--duration-fast) ease;
  }

  .dependency-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .dependency-index {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .dependency-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .dependency-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }


  .evidence-block {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--surface-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .evidence-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }

  .evidence-item {
    padding-right: var(--space-4);
  }

  .evidence-number {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    color: var(--accent-blue);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.4vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .evidence-item p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }


  .local-first-thesis {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface-canvas) 0%, var(--surface-card) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .thesis-header {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .thesis-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .thesis-header h3 strong {
    color: var(--accent-blue);
  }

  /* Principles Chips */
  .thesis-principles {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .principle-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--surface-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .principle-chip strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .chip-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .dot-teal { background: var(--accent-teal); }
  .dot-blue { background: var(--accent-blue); }
  .dot-indigo { background: #6366f1; }


  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .dependency-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .dependency-grid,
    .evidence-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .evidence-item {
      padding-right: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
